# Line endings are load-bearing here. .github/workflows/publish.yml re-runs the
# generators and fails on ANY diff, and the generators emit LF. A checkout that
# rewrote line endings — Git for Windows with core.autocrlf=true, say — makes
# every generated file read as drifted, so the gate goes red on a tree nobody
# touched. Normalize to LF in the index and in the working tree, everywhere,
# rather than relying on each clone being configured correctly.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never rewrite these bytes, never try to diff them.
*.xlsx binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
